OL,3,GNEWSAApology after two women's rights
OL,4,Acampaigners banned
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a public statement, the council
OL,7,Fwithdrew its allegations against the
OL,8,Fwomen and admitted there should have
OL,9,Fbeen an investigation before they were
OL,10,Fbanned.
